{"Lithuanian (lt) localization file messages_lt.properties in account folder contains Italian text instead of Lithuanian translation": 0.9724695682525635, "replaceFirst() in anchor sanitization causes false positives with repeated anchors": 0.8343831896781921, "POLICY_SOME_HTML allows anchor tags but they're not included in the allowElements list, meaning anchor tags will be stripped by the sanitizer before the custom santizeAnchors() method runs": 0.6247493028640747, "The regex pattern `_[a-zA-Z-_]*\\.properties` will incorrectly match files that are already English (e.g., `_en.properties` would be transformed to `_en_en.properties`)": 0.5035273432731628, "The HTML_TAGS pattern `<[a-z]+[^>]*>` only matches lowercase tag names, but HTML is case-insensitive, allowing bypass with uppercase tags like `<DIV>` or `<Script>`": 0.7931402325630188, "The unescape and comment removal happen unconditionally for all values, which could mask legitimate security issues if a translator intentionally includes HTML comments or already-escaped entities": 0.28838321566581726, "Anchor sanitization method doesn't validate anchor attributes (href, target) where XSS risk actually resides": 0.7799590229988098, "Protection scope is limited to repository-managed translations built through Maven - custom themes and message bundles loaded at runtime are completely bypassed": 0.3904118239879608, "HTML detection relies on regex patterns that are fragile and potentially bypassable": 0.31252220273017883, "Build-time-only enforcement means no runtime safeguard exists for custom/operator-provided message bundles": 0.6772839426994324}